    "summary": "Whenever an attack by one of this unit’s POXWALKER models destroys an enemy model other than a MONSTER or VEHICLE model, you may bring one destroyed POXWALKER model back into the unit after the unit finishes resolving its attacks. While TYPHUS leads this unit, any enemy model destroyed through the Eater Plague ability of TYPHUS is treated, for this ability, as destroyed by an attack from one of this unit’s POXWALKER models.",
